{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Update</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025/11/27 Updated from ver.1.0.0 to <strong>ver.1.0.1</strong> (Fixed a bug where Traditional Chinese text would display as English in Chapters 2 and 5.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Future Schedule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epilogue scheduled for free addition in Spring 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;&quot;Knights College 2&quot;&quot; is the sequel to the previous title, &quot;&quot;Knights College.&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the story is connected, we recommend enjoying the first game before playing this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Development Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStreaming gameplay footage of &quot;&quot;Knights College 2&quot;&quot; is allowed up to Chapter 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Due to the story-driven nature of this visual novel, streaming from Chapter 2 onward is prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe recommend playing this game on Windows 10 (64-bit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Supported Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese, English, Traditional Chinese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(More to be added)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argo, a young man who had been living a quiet life in a rural fishing village,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has entered the Knight Academy to become a knight and successfully advanced to his second year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The academy, composed of students from the homeland Frontail and international students from neighboring Harshreich,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >welcomes new students from each country again this year, starting a new season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/e2d2214f172422fbda00ba1f7a5ea835.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/e2d2214f172422fbda00ba1f7a5ea835.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the dragon Baten from Ludovigo joins as a student,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the knight commander Bayfreed returns from his expedition,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bringing even more color to Argo\u2019s academy life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 New Features in &quot;2&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cb Graphics Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Character sprites have been renewed, and emotes have been added to the dialogue screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Character expressions now animate in sync with the sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/c805f53ef23cbfc3dcded79b6212bc8f.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/c805f53ef23cbfc3dcded79b6212bc8f.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/0d925e12a19894dd1bc4f1270066c6e4.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/0d925e12a19894dd1bc4f1270066c6e4.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cb New Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000New characters include Gamir, a new student from Frontail; Felix, an international student from Harshreich;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000and Knight Commander Bayfreed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000(Another character appears later in the game.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/02b333643afc07e9a0b0a0ad2f827b7a.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/02b333643afc07e9a0b0a0ad2f827b7a.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cb New Cards</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000In addition to cards from the previous title, 100 types of cards including newly added ones will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/273d1ce5b15f6b0af9ab43d4f3e805ca.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/273d1ce5b15f6b0af9ab43d4f3e805ca.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cb Roommate Selection</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000In the previous game, roommates were fixed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000In this game, you can choose between Theo and Grantley.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/7354958e99c230410f25945f205f5d62.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/7354958e99c230410f25945f205f5d62.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Cards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;&quot;Knights College 2,&quot;&quot; all actions such as conversations and movement are made through card selections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtaining new cards unlocks conversations or opens new routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/7e50608edf729e6f3ecf1150dd4acd4b.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/7e50608edf729e6f3ecf1150dd4acd4b.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/a4ba22b002cc466102791bbededd857a.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/a4ba22b002cc466102791bbededd857a.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Bath Talking</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As in the previous game, you can take baths with someone during bath time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll get to see a different side of the characters than you would during the day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/dcf464a4d4036cdb971f2bd87bfef509.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/dcf464a4d4036cdb971f2bd87bfef509.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Chapter 1 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/220cd63621e4922cad17941ca1d1062f26f28079.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 2 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/4b06bdd6da64a23f0b1d6b23da491ab00f8badcb.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 3 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/4277ba91260d5f799ea87cd605ab1a5e6d09fe88.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 4 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/fa56ada5e79c0eab586180ca27d34442b6938813.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 5 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/3ec1bc1dc2c02b669693b670e1233403eba167bd.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 6 Clear","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/2525484e32b84fddab0ae5b60c78dd5e0e0918b3.jpg"},{"name":"True End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/53f70453d743430a83370fcea2236b420e3243f7.jpg"},{"name":"Card Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/16f0f22031fd03b48fa010672a5faee7be556ef5.jpg"},{"name":"Star Completed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3850870/1b758802a03494c46b4027f3f21b56f5d9da58e8.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3850870?t=1764330065","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/85af3a5d22a4b741494d5c087b2f1cf8c7d4a6b8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764330065","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/fb91e29603cb6267e4ea61f575617a91e8c6c44c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764330065","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/fb91e29603cb6267e4ea61f575617a91e8c6c44c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764330065","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"There is a scene where they take a bath together. In that scene, they are wearing towels."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Update</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2025/11/27 Updated from ver.1.0.0 to <strong>ver.1.0.1</strong> (Fixed a bug where Traditional Chinese text would display as English in Chapters 2 and 5.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Future Schedule</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Epilogue scheduled for free addition in Spring 2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Introduction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;&quot;Knights College 2&quot;&quot; is the sequel to the previous title, &quot;&quot;Knights College.&quot;&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Since the story is connected, we recommend enjoying the first game before playing this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Development Notice</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStreaming gameplay footage of &quot;&quot;Knights College 2&quot;&quot; is allowed up to Chapter 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Due to the story-driven nature of this visual novel, streaming from Chapter 2 onward is prohibited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbWe recommend playing this game on Windows 10 (64-bit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Supported Languages</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese, English, Traditional Chinese</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(More to be added)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Argo, a young man who had been living a quiet life in a rural fishing village,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >has entered the Knight Academy to become a knight and successfully advanced to his second year.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The academy, composed of students from the homeland Frontail and international students from neighboring Harshreich,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >welcomes new students from each country again this year, starting a new season.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/e2d2214f172422fbda00ba1f7a5ea835.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/e2d2214f172422fbda00ba1f7a5ea835.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the dragon Baten from Ludovigo joins as a student,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and the knight commander Bayfreed returns from his expedition,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >bringing even more color to Argo\u2019s academy life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0 New Features in &quot;2&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25cb Graphics Overhaul</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Character sprites have been renewed, and emotes have been added to the dialogue screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Character expressions now animate in sync with the sprites.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/c805f53ef23cbfc3dcded79b6212bc8f.avif?t=1764330065\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras_big/c805f53ef23cbfc3dcded79b6212bc8f.avif?t=1764330065 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850870/extras/0d925e12a